      "name": "Title",
      "value": "Transcription profiling by array of post-mortem brain cortex from healthy control patients and amyotrophic lateral sclerosis patients that carry an expanded GGGGCC repeat mutation in the chromosome 9 open reading frame 72 (C9ORF72) gene"
